        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony Scott, Brian Helgeland, A. J. Quinnell\n- Music Groups: Kinky\n- Songs: \"Más\"\n- Films: Man on Fire\n- Video Games: SSX 3\n- Topics: adaptations, soundtrack appearances\n\nFacts:\n- A. J. Quinnell wrote the 1980 novel Man on Fire.\n- The 2004 film Man on Fire is a British-American crime thriller.\n- Tony Scott directed the 2004 film Man on Fire.\n- Brian Helgeland wrote the screenplay for the 2004 film Man on Fire.\n- The 2004 film Man on Fire is based on A. J. Quinnell's 1980 novel of the same name.\n- Kinky recorded the song \"Más.\"\n- Kinky's song \"Más\" is featured in the PlayStation 2 video game SSX 3.\n- Kinky's song \"Más\" is featured in the 2004 film Man on Fire.",
